  "title": "Claude AI open-sources code setup with 181 skills and 79 commands #shorts #claudeai #opensource",
  "description": "Everything Claude Code is an open-source project by Anthropic Hackathon winner Afan Mustafa, designed to transform Claude into a versatile development team. After 10 months of real-world refinement, it features 181 skills, 47 sub-agents, and 79 commands that automate tasks such as security scanning, memory optimization, and session-based learning. Compatible with Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, and Gemini, this setup enables rapid software development, demonstrated by the creator building a startup in just eight hours and winning the grand prize. This project highlights the potential of advanced AI-driven tooling to streamline complex coding workflows, enhance productivity, and accelerate innovation in software development. It represents a significant step in leveraging AI as collaborative developer teams rather than standalone assistants, offering substantial value for developers and startups aiming for faster time-to-market and improved code quality. #everythingclaudecode #anthropichackathon #afanmustafa #claudecode #cursor #codex #gemini #aidevelopment #aiworkflow #softwareautomation #hackathonwinner #aitools #startupdevelopment #codeoptimization #securityscanning",
